{"title":"천재 아이돌의 연예계 공략법","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=dmXKdI/hAd4bzfVSw/zqiQ1xQ1DmZYx43cfCVWaK&filename=th3","synopsis":"천 년에 한 번 나올 미모의 연습생 온하제.\n스폰서 제의를 걷어차며 데뷔도 날아간 이후\n다시는 연예계에 발 들이지 않겠다 다짐했다.\n\n웬 아이돌 육성 게임에 빙의하기 전까지는.\n\n숨겨왔던 재능 찾아 아이돌로 성장하랴,\n말 안 듣는 시스템이랑 밀당하랴,\n빙의한 캐릭터 과거 추리하랴.\n\n돈도, 집도, 아는 것도 없이\n개고생은 개고생대로 다 했는데….\n\n“큰일이다. 이거 재밌다.”\n\n되는대로, 하는 대로, 마음 가는 대로.\n일단 직진, 도전, 그리고 공략!\n천재 아이돌 온라온의 연예계 공략기.\n\n#얼굴만_잘하는_줄_알았는데\n#알고_보니_팔방미인_천재_아이돌","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":278,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":245,"change":{"type":"up","amount":33}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":221,"change":{"type":"up","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":276,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":254,"change":{"type":"up","amount":22}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":277,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":285,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":231,"change":{"type":"up","amount":54}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":171,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":188,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":222,"change":{"type":"down","amount":34}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank":268,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-01","rank":260,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-09-02","rank":219,"change":{"type":"up","amount":41}},{"date":"2026-09-04","rank":264,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-05","rank":236,"change":{"type":"up","amount":28}},{"date":"2026-09-06","rank":188,"change":{"type":"up","amount":48}},{"date":"2026-09-07","rank":189,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-09-09","rank":241,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-09-10","rank":225,"change":{"type":"up","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-09-14","rank":291,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"202